## 🌟 Example

Imagine a college student who wants to:

* Improve Java
* Learn guitar
* Practice cricket
* Learn photography
* Improve cooking

Normally, they may need several different platforms.

With SkillSnap, these interests can become part of one learning profile:

```text
             My SkillSnap

📚 Java          → 80%
🎵 Guitar        → 50%
⚽ Cricket       → 65%
📷 Photography  → 40%
🍳 Cooking       → 55%
```

This creates a more connected and personalized learning experience.

